# A character who bounces between two classes that both grant Uncanny Dodge,
# to read what the engine gives him when their levels are supposed to stack.
#
# Barbarian and Rogue both carry the sentence "Levels of this ability from the
# barbarian and rogue classes stack" -- lib/classes.irh:118 and :2395. The
# rogue's own prose ties the thresholds to its class level: off-guard immunity
# at 3rd, forewarning at 5th, flanking immunity at 6th (lib/classes.irh:2383-
# 2394). So six levels of the two classes together should reach the flanking
# threshold, which src/Creature.cpp:637 reads as the number 4.
#
# THE ORACLE is the sheet's Special Abilities block: src/Sheet.cpp:580-582
# prints "Improved Uncanny Dodge" at 4 or more and plain "Uncanny Dodge"
# below it.
#
# Barbarian 3 gives 2 (its grant starts at its 2nd level) and Rogue 3 gives 1
# (starting at its 3rd), so the character holds 3 and is still flankable.

a
n
y
@choose "Human"
@choose "Spot"
@choose "Searching"
@choose "Barbarian"
a
@choose "Neutral"
@until "Unspent Skill Ranks" a
# Ten ranks, two to a skill. No skill gate matters here, but character
# generation will not release a character with a rank unspent.
@cursorto:mark "Athletics" DOWN
RIGHT*3
@cursorto:mark "Climb" DOWN
RIGHT*3
@cursorto:mark "Craft" DOWN
RIGHT*3
@cursorto:mark "Healing" DOWN
RIGHT*3
@cursorto:mark "Intimidate" DOWN
RIGHT*3
ENTER y
a                       # personality archetype
@until "Afoot" ESC
w
@expect "Enter wizard mode"
y
w
DOWN DOWN
SPACE                   # Free Advancement: NO -> YES
ESC

d
G
@while "Bonus To Which Attribute" a
@while "Choose a feat" a
ESC
d
G
@while "Bonus To Which Attribute" a
@while "Choose a feat" a
ESC
d
G
@while "Bonus To Which Attribute" a
@while "Choose a feat" a
ESC
d
@expect "Barbarian 3"

M                       # [M]ulticlass
@choose "Rogue"
ESC
d
@expect "Rogue 0"

@until "class do you wish to advance" G
@choose "Rogue"
@while "Bonus To Which Attribute" a
@while "Choose a feat" a
ESC
d
@until "class do you wish to advance" G
@choose "Rogue"
@while "Bonus To Which Attribute" a
@while "Choose a feat" a
ESC
d
@until "class do you wish to advance" G
@choose "Rogue"
@while "Bonus To Which Attribute" a
@while "Choose a feat" a
ESC
d
@expect "Rogue 3"
@dump:barbrogue

W
b r 3 ENTER
ESC
@quit
